#. ２年間の記憶なんて…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Two years' worth of memories..."
msgstr ""

#. 私は<CLT 9>絶対になくさない<CLT>よ！
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I <CLT 9>could never lose<CLT> something like that!"
msgstr ""

#. この学園で２年間も
#. 学生生活…？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "We've been living here for two years...?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ、あり得ねーって！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hell no! That's impossible!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は楽しい学校行事は
#. おろか…
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I mean, I haven't gone to any awesome\n"
"school events or anything..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>授業すら受けてねー<CLT>ぞ！
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Heck, I've never even gone to <CLT 9>a single class<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 現実離れ…し過ぎている…！
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This is all just...surreal!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、
#. <CLT 9>２年も経ってた<CLT>ら…
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Plus,\n"
"if <CLT 9>two years have passed<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺は一体いくつだべ！？
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...how freakin' old am I!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…
#. もめてるもめてる…
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu...\n"
"Everyone's so conflicted!"
msgstr ""

